  common_defenses = '{"Statutory construction — defendant''s conduct does not fall within the plain language of the statute.","Constitutional challenge — the statute is unconstitutionally vague, overbroad, or violates due process as applied.","Insufficient evidence — prosecution cannot prove all elements beyond reasonable doubt.","Mistake of fact or law — defendant''s reasonable misunderstanding of the law or facts negates the required mental state."}'
