  prosecution_strengths = '{"Intoxilyzer 9000 results are presumptively admissible when proper foundation is laid by the State.","Georgia''s per se prohibition extends to drugs — any amount of marijuana metabolites can support DUI-drugs conviction.","Georgia ALS (Administrative License Suspension) creates additional prosecution leverage independent of criminal case."}',
