  defense_opportunities = '{"First offense is only a violation (non-criminal) in Kentucky — one of the mildest reckless driving penalties nationally","Common plea-down charge from DUI, making it a favorable negotiation outcome for defendants","Low maximum penalty ($100 fine for first violation) limits prosecution leverage","No mandatory minimum penalties for first offense"}',
