  common_defenses = '{"Challenging the wantonness element — arguing the defendant''s mental state did not rise to conscious disregard of a known risk","Contributory negligence of the victim — the deceased''s own conduct contributed to the fatal outcome","Sudden emergency doctrine — the defendant faced an unexpected situation requiring split-second decisions","Expert testimony challenging the prosecution''s accident reconstruction or cause-of-death determination"}'
