  common_defenses = '{"Extreme emotional disturbance (EED) — reduces murder to manslaughter if proven by a preponderance of evidence","Identity defense — the defendant was not the person who committed the killing","Challenging forensic evidence — DNA contamination, eyewitness misidentification, unreliable informant testimony","Alibi defense — defendant was elsewhere when the crime occurred"}'
