  defense_opportunities = '{"Identity is frequently the central issue — misidentification is a leading cause of wrongful convictions in robbery cases","The force element must be connected to the theft — force occurring after the taking may not satisfy the statute","Challenging the value of the property taken may affect sentencing","Plea negotiations to theft charges (without the force element) significantly reduce exposure"}',
