  prosecution_strengths = '{"NC maintains full criminal prohibition on marijuana — no recreational or medical program exists","Amounts over 1.5 oz are a Class I felony, and over 10 lbs triggers mandatory trafficking minimums","Even small amounts (0.5 oz to 1.5 oz) are a Class 1 misdemeanor with up to 120 days"}',
