  defense_opportunities = '{"Basic simple assault is a Class 2 misdemeanor with only 60 days maximum — among NC''s lower-level offenses","The threat-based assault theory (apprehension of harm without contact) requires the victim to have been aware of the threat","Mutual combat or consensual altercation can negate the ''without consent'' element"}',
