  prosecution_strengths = '{"With serious injury, this is a Class E felony (88 months max); with intent to kill and serious injury, it escalates to Class C (231 months)","The ''deadly weapon'' definition is broad — virtually any object used in a manner capable of causing death qualifies","Medical records documenting injuries provide objective evidence of the weapon''s effect"}',
