  defense_opportunities = '{"Negotiate down to manslaughter by establishing heat of passion or imperfect self-defense.","Challenge implied malice — mere recklessness may not suffice.","Self-defense defenses can fully exonerate.","Challenge causation, especially in attenuated circumstances.","Mental state defenses including voluntary intoxication negating specific intent."}',
