  common_defenses = '{"Improper stop — officer lacked reasonable suspicion for the initial traffic stop","Sleeping it off — defendant had no intent to drive while in actual physical control","Rising blood alcohol — BAC was below .08 at time of driving but rose between the stop and the test","Field sobriety test inaccuracy — fatigue, weather conditions, terrain, or medical conditions affected performance"}'
